   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/cunning/survival.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You search a nearby grid for a hidden trap (%d detection 'power') and disarm it if possible (%d disarm 'power', based on your skill with %s).\n\t\tDisarming a trap requires at least a minimum skill level, and you must be able to enter the trap's grid to manipulate it, though you stay in your current location.  A failed attempt to disarm a trap may trigger it.\n\t\tYour skill improves with your your Cunning.",
   "target": "你搜索邻近的一个地格中隐藏的陷阱（侦察强度 %d）， 并在可能时将其解除（解除强度 %d， 取决于你的%s技能）。\n\t\t解除陷阱有最低技能等级需求，且你必须能够移动到陷阱的所在格，尽管你仍然留在你的当前位置。\n\t\t解除陷阱失败可能会触发陷阱。\n\t\t解除能力随灵巧值提升。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/cunning/survival.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    189
   ]
  },
