  {
   "id": "5aee27a2e1b4",
   "unit_id": "5aee27a2e1b416e682901481cc3026d53a565eee2e38a772164e91b5a74a1969",
   "revision_key": "fb024985bddb6301231063e384d30d24f94fc925796013277bd2ff9323ddfafa",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 30189,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/techniques/buckler-training.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Any time you block an attack with Buckler Expertise or Buckler Mastery you instantly counterattack with your sling for %d%% damage  This can only occur up to %d time(s) per turn.\n\t\t\t",
   "target": "每当你的格挡专精或格挡大师技能挡住攻击时，你立刻使用投石索发动一次伤害 %d%% 的反击。每回合最多可发动 %d 次反击，外加 1 次。\n\t\t\t",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/buckler-training.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    252
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "183a632f696b",
   "unit_id": "183a632f696bf9b059f4c8c61d197ee034edb4613776327318925ec88d267071",
   "revision_key": "02276cd5a9e69d48c08d02c754759795c948ef0bcd9c2e9fb3662b74df4cdf6e",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 30231,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/techniques/combat-training.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "You become better at using your armour to deflect blows and protect your vital areas. Increases Armour value by %d, Armour hardiness by %d%%, and reduces the chance melee or ranged attacks critically hit you by %d%% with your current body armour.\n\t\t(This talent only provides bonuses for heavy mail or massive plate armour.)\n\t\tAt level 1, it allows you to wear heavy mail armour, gauntlets, helms, and heavy boots.\n\t\tAt level 2, it allows you to wear shields.\n\t\tAt level 3, it allows you to wear massive plate armour.\n\t\t%s",
   "target": "你使用防具来偏转攻击和保护重要部位的能力加强了。\n\t\t根据现有防具，提高 %d 护甲值和 %d%% 护甲强度，并使近战或远程攻击对你造成暴击的几率降低 %d%%。\n\t\t（这项技能只对重甲或板甲提供加成。）\n\t\t在等级 1 时，能使你装备重甲、金属手套、头盔和重靴。\n\t\t在等级 2 时，能使你装备盾牌。\n\t\t在等级 3 时，能使你装备板甲。\n\t\t%s",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/combat-training.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    106
   ]
  },
